{"skill":{"slug":"skill-finder","displayName":"Skill Finder (Find ClawHub skills + Search Skills.sh)"},"version":{"version":"1.1.5","createdAt":1773252253041,"changelog":"Broader discovery guidance for finding better, safer, and more relevant skills faster.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":9412,"sha256":"0c9577f7c0fdbbb2b1374349e8596cb65a9de37b6db971e1f02b954b1e1f3b5e","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"categories.md","size":2405,"sha256":"1c83beb38f98b66bb7459a0d1c50c8dffd69c7bed918c557634837cad43b5430","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"evaluate.md","size":3605,"sha256":"9db7abd36e917cfb6b41b318e1ec78b6f5613c8d88b11525bb0e6c9246b4f6f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"memory-template.md","size":2594,"sha256":"aa81c8fbc3e4da354aceb56b962daf7256c17fecbbbb9e3a894bdf66eaeba721","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"migration.md","size":2096,"sha256":"08b2f45eb9a95d7f3fc3facc454e8b4e6019d882ad419e68a2786c2b955c93bf","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"search.md","size":4802,"sha256":"13cdf90653c46d4feda8437688817f54e7cc4599128a1f2014d9297e52ddf51c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"setup.md","size":3042,"sha256":"5c3ef3389718d3dd34474a62f0a1f844878fe543d2417231f1aa59cbf43fe02b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"troubleshooting.md","size":3920,"sha256":"5d3de86adb70fa25136fe9a099d279e6ea6be6d08c950b458522246c31657d3a","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2730,"sha256":"ca2556f1f47e980f2a22184215eb530fa29234d6bc23e1004b725f2030b1be50","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"suspicious","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789061404983,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"b54b443d6bbe1a48c10cdd129da5ec3bd836efe55f7cba555ac292dc4f6c902e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b54b443d6bbe1a48c10cdd129da5ec3bd836efe55f7cba555ac292dc4f6c902e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: skill-finder\nVersion: 1.1.5\n\nThe 'skill-finder' bundle is a utility designed to help AI agents discover and install additional capabilities from the ClawHub and Skills.sh registries. The logic is entirely consistent with its stated purpose, and the SKILL.md instructions include explicit security constraints, such as forbidding the use of force-install flags (-y) and requiring user consent before installation. It manages local state in a dedicated directory (~/skill-finder/) and provides structured evaluation criteria (evaluate.md) to help the agent avoid low-quality or outdated packages.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779163217002},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":90,"severity":"CRITICAL","recommendation":"DO_NOT_INSTALL","issueCount":67,"checkedAt":1789061404983},"llm":{"status":"suspicious","verdict":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill has a useful purpose, but it needs review because setup can persistently change agent routing and its commands run unpinned external CLIs.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Local preference memory under ~/skill-finder/ is proportionate, but automatic steering plus default dual-source external search is broader than a simple discovery helper needs unless users explicitly opt in.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The documented workflow repeatedly uses unpinned npx clawhub and npx skills commands, so search, inspect, list, update, and install actions may execute whatever package version resolves at runtime.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The artifacts claim local-only storage and no access outside ~/skill-finder/, but setup instructs adding persistent routing lines to AGENTS.md or a workspace routing section outside that folder.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"The skill does not request root privileges or install services, but it asks to persist future agent behavior through AGENTS.md and memory loading, which is high-impact agent configuration persistence.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"concern"},{"detail":"Finding, comparing, and installing skills is the stated purpose, and search/install behavior is mostly aligned, but activation is broad enough to trigger on ordinary 'how do I do X' requests and send queries to external registries without clear intent.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"concern"}],"guidance":"Review this before installing. Decline or manually edit the AGENTS.md steering unless you explicitly want this skill loaded for future capability-related requests. Prefer pinned, reviewed versions of the clawhub and skills CLIs, inspect candidate skills before installation, and avoid sending sensitive task details as registry search queries.","findings":"[SDI-4] unexpected: Accepted as material: setup states no data is written outside ~/skill-finder/ while later instructing an AGENTS.md or routing-file update outside that boundary.\n[SDI-1] unexpected: Accepted as material: the proposed AGENTS.md line causes future matching requests to always load this skill and its memory; this is disclosed in setup but conflicts with the local-only boundary and lacks a separate opt-in/reversal step.\n[SQP-1] unexpected: Accepted as a scoping concern: the trigger examples include generic help requests, which can steer normal tasks toward external skill search and installation recommendations.\n[RP1] expected: Accepted with context: use of ClawHub and Skills.sh CLIs fits the skill's purpose, but the commands are unpinned and therefore carry avoidable supply-chain risk.\n[T02] unexpected: The static finding is supported by setup.md and migration.md instructions to add or update persistent agent routing for this skill.\n[T08] expected: The static finding is supported by repeated unpinned npx command examples; this is purpose-aligned but under-controlled for an installation-oriented skill.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789061404983}}}}}